Function:
  - (recharges)
  + (total-cost) :total-cost
Action:
  - recharge: ?x - rover ?w - waypoint
      pre: (and (<= (energy ?x) 80) (in ?x ?w) (in_sun ?w))
      eff: (and (increase (energy ?x) 20) (increase (recharges) 1))
  + recharge: ?x - rover ?w - waypoint
      pre: (and (<= (energy ?x) 80) (in ?x ?w) (in_sun ?w))
      eff: (and (increase (energy ?x) 20) (increase (total-cost) 1))
Init:
  - (= (recharges) 0)
  + (= (total-cost) 0)
Metric:
  - (recharges)
  + (total-cost)
Func prop:
  - (recharges): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
  + (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
Global prop:
  - action_cost_func:(recharges)
  + action_cost_func:(total-cost)
